There's a high risk that your pet will get killed, either by a wand or
because of the masses of creatures there. If I want to be sure about
the health of my pet I would leave him outside; in that case you must
take care that he does not go feral, though. OTOH, lot's of kills will
advance your pet and make it even more powerful. So, as long as your
pet is not in line-of-fire that might be okay. Have you a magic whistle
to control your dragon? I think I'd take him with me to Ludios; that
might shorten your time there. Do you know how to handle the masses of
soldiers best? If you do it right them there's little to fear about the
line-of-fire.

